# Feedback Loop (Continuous Training)
# data/feedback is intentionally tracked so that a push can trigger CT.
# Use scripts/auto_push_feedback.py or `make feedback-push` to publish batches.
# The API keeps its push bookkeeping locally; it is not repository content.
data/feedback/.pushed.json
data/feedback/.pushed.json.tmp

